-- q14 NEGATED-CONJUNCTION PIN: corrected, to the officer's satisfaction -- but LATE.
-- All three limbs must hold for the proprietor to escape; two do.
#EVAL `the enforcement officer may cancel the registration of the hotel`
        (Premises WITH `a price list for alcohol is displayed on the premises` IS FALSE,
                       `the premises are registered as a hotel` IS FALSE,
                       `the enforcement officer believes that the price list is misleading to customers` IS FALSE,
                       `the enforcement officer has issued a warning to the proprietor of premises` IS TRUE,
                       `the proprietor corrects the price list` IS TRUE,
                       `the proprietor does so to the satisfaction of the enforcement officer` IS TRUE,
                       `the proprietor does so within 5 days after the warning was issued` IS FALSE)
